	(text "How to read this page: signals flow left to right. The 12-way ribbon (page 5)\ncarries the SPI and the 5 V / 3.3 V rails from the control board to the power board;\nthe isolator, DAC and ADC (page 6) straddle the barrier. V_SET (page 7) is the one\nnode the four channels follow; KILL (page 9) stops them; the source-node average AVG\nreturns to the sense amplifier (page 8); DRAIN comes from the terminals (page 10) and\nends at the dropout comparator. The channels (pages 11-14, sheets/channel.kicad_sch)\nare drawn as a chain: a *_T pin is the same net leaving on the right. PGND / AGND /\nDGND and the rails are global power symbols on the sheets."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 248.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "99022bc3-a26e-5bbd-9d17-6b5788e38c25")
	)
